libghostty-vt (Ghostty) — MIT
================================================================================

Houston vendors a build of Ghostty's terminal-emulation library. The daemon
links the native library and the renderer loads a WebAssembly build of it:

  ui/src/renderer/src/ghostty/vendor/ghostty-vt.wasm
  ui/src/renderer/src/ghostty/vendor/ghostty-write-pty.wasm
  core/houston-core/ghostty-patches/

Both artifacts are built from https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty at the
revision pinned in core/houston-core/ghostty-vt.lock. MIT asks that a copy of
the software carry this notice, so here it is in full:

